FRONTUI_AI_TITLE = AI connection
FRONTUI_AI_HELP = Configure the provider used by this AI workspace and future module automations. No request is sent until you explicitly test or use it.
FRONTUI_AI_ENABLED = Enable the AI connection
FRONTUI_AI_DISABLED = No LLM provider is configured for this account.
FRONTUI_AI_CONNECTION_SECTION = Provider connection
FRONTUI_AI_MODEL_SECTION = Model and response
FRONTUI_AI_PROVIDER = Provider:
FRONTUI_AI_PROVIDER_OPENAI = OpenAI API
FRONTUI_AI_PROVIDER_ANTHROPIC = Anthropic API
FRONTUI_AI_PROVIDER_GEMINI = Google Gemini API
FRONTUI_AI_PROVIDER_MISTRAL = Mistral API
FRONTUI_AI_PROVIDER_OLLAMA = Ollama
FRONTUI_AI_MODEL = Model identifier:
FRONTUI_AI_MODEL_INSTALL = Install this model on Ollama
FRONTUI_AI_MODEL_INSTALLING = Installing model…
FRONTUI_AI_MODEL_INSTALL_HELP = WebHome asks this Ollama instance to download the exact model entered above. The download starts only when you press this button and may use several gigabytes.
FRONTUI_AI_MODEL_INSTALLING_STATUS = Ollama is downloading and installing the model. Keep this page open; this can take several minutes.
FRONTUI_AI_MODEL_INSTALL_PROGRESS_LABEL = Current Ollama download progress
FRONTUI_AI_MODEL_INSTALL_SUCCESS = Ollama installed the model successfully. You can now test the connection.
FRONTUI_AI_MODELS_LOAD = Load available models
FRONTUI_AI_MODELS_LOADING = Loading models…
FRONTUI_AI_MODELS_HELP = OpenAI model discovery is optional and requires model-list read permission for the key. You can always enter an identifier manually.
FRONTUI_AI_MODELS_AVAILABLE = Available models:
FRONTUI_AI_MODELS_SELECT = Select a model…
FRONTUI_AI_MODELS_LOADING_STATUS = The available OpenAI models are being requested directly from the provider.
FRONTUI_AI_MODELS_SUCCESS = The available models were loaded. Select one from the list, then test the connection to validate its response contract.
FRONTUI_AI_URL = Ollama origin:
FRONTUI_AI_URL_HELP = Enter only the exact HTTP(S) origin, without a path. It must also be allowed by llm_allowed_origins and expose a compatible CORS policy.
FRONTUI_AI_OLLAMA_SERVER_TEST = Check Ollama server
FRONTUI_AI_OLLAMA_SERVER_TESTING = Checking Ollama server…
FRONTUI_AI_OLLAMA_SERVER_HELP = WebHome checks that this origin is reachable and exposes a valid Ollama API before displaying the model settings.
FRONTUI_AI_OLLAMA_SERVER_SUCCESS = Ollama connection validated for this origin.
FRONTUI_AI_OLLAMA_SERVER_TESTING_STATUS = WebHome is checking the Ollama version directly from the configured origin.
FRONTUI_AI_CREDENTIAL = API credential:
FRONTUI_AI_CREDENTIAL_OPTIONAL = API credential (optional for local Ollama):
FRONTUI_AI_MAX_TOKENS = Maximum output tokens:
FRONTUI_AI_BYOK_WARNING = Your credential is encrypted before WebHome stores it. It is decrypted in this browser and sent directly to the selected provider; the WebHome API never receives it. A compromised WebHome origin or browser extension can still access data present in the page.
FRONTUI_AI_TEST = Test connection
FRONTUI_AI_TESTING = Testing…
FRONTUI_AI_TESTING_STATUS = A bounded test request is being sent directly to the selected provider.
FRONTUI_AI_TEST_SUCCESS = Direct connection succeeded and the response contract is valid.
FRONTAI_CONFIG_INVALID = The AI configuration is invalid or uses an unsupported version.
FRONTAI_CONFIG_TOO_LARGE = The AI configuration exceeds the allowed size.
FRONTAI_CONFIG_MODEL_INVALID = Enter a valid model identifier of at most 256 bytes, without whitespace.
FRONTAI_CONFIG_CREDENTIAL_INVALID = Enter a valid API credential within the allowed size.
FRONTAI_CONFIG_URL_INVALID = Enter an exact HTTP(S) Ollama origin, without credentials, path, query or fragment.
FRONTAI_CONFIG_TOKENS_INVALID = Maximum output tokens must be between 256 and 8192.
FRONTAI_SAVE_AUTH_REQUIRED = Your session has expired. Sign in again before saving the AI configuration.
FRONTAI_SAVE_OUTDATED = A newer AI configuration was found on the server and has been reloaded. Review it before saving again.
FRONTAI_SAVE_INTERRUPTED = The AI configuration save was interrupted by an account or page transition.
FRONTAI_SAVE_SERVER_ERROR = The encrypted AI configuration could not be saved. Please try again.
FRONTAI_TEST_REQUEST_INVALID = The bounded test request could not be prepared.
FRONTAI_TEST_BUSY = Two LLM requests are already active. Try again when one has finished.
FRONTAI_TEST_INSECURE_TRANSPORT = An HTTP LLM endpoint cannot be contacted from an HTTPS page.
FRONTAI_TEST_WEBHOME_ORIGIN_FORBIDDEN = The LLM endpoint cannot use the WebHome origin because credentials must never be sent to the WebHome server.
FRONTAI_TEST_ORIGIN_NOT_ALLOWED = This Ollama origin is not allowed by the WebHome configuration. Add its exact origin to llm_allowed_origins, then restart WebHome.
FRONTAI_TEST_TRANSPORT = The browser could not reach the provider. Check its URL, CSP entry, CORS policy and network availability.
FRONTAI_TEST_TIMEOUT = The provider did not complete the request within 180 seconds.
FRONTAI_TEST_UNAUTHORIZED = The provider rejected the credential or does not allow direct browser access for this account.
FRONTAI_TEST_RATE_LIMITED = The provider rate limit or usage budget was reached.
FRONTAI_TEST_MODEL_UNAVAILABLE = The provider endpoint or model identifier was not found.
FRONTAI_TEST_OLLAMA_MODEL_UNAVAILABLE = This model is not installed on this Ollama instance. Use the install button above, or enter an already installed model identifier.
FRONTAI_TEST_OLLAMA_RESPONSE_WITHOUT_TEXT = Ollama answered, but the model produced only internal reasoning or reached the output limit before its final text. Try the test again; WebHome asks Ollama to disable thinking for this adapter.
FRONTAI_OLLAMA_SERVER_REQUEST_INVALID = The Ollama server check could not be prepared. Verify the origin and optional credential.
FRONTAI_OLLAMA_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE = This origin does not expose the expected Ollama version endpoint.
FRONTAI_OLLAMA_SERVER_TIMEOUT = The Ollama server did not answer within 10 seconds.
FRONTAI_OLLAMA_SERVER_REJECTED = The Ollama server rejected the version check. Verify this instance's access policy.
FRONTAI_OLLAMA_SERVER_FAILURE = The Ollama server failed while checking its version.
FRONTAI_OLLAMA_SERVER_RESPONSE_INVALID = This origin answered, but its response does not match the Ollama version API.
FRONTAI_MODEL_INSTALL_REQUEST_INVALID = The bounded Ollama installation request could not be prepared.
FRONTAI_MODEL_INSTALL_UNAVAILABLE = Ollama could not find this exact model identifier in its registry. Check the model name and tag.
FRONTAI_MODEL_INSTALL_TIMEOUT = The Ollama installation did not finish within 30 minutes. Check the model on Ollama before retrying, as the download may still be active.
FRONTAI_MODEL_INSTALL_REJECTED = Ollama rejected the model installation request. Check the model identifier and this instance's permissions.
FRONTAI_MODEL_INSTALL_FAILURE = Ollama failed while downloading or installing the model. Check the Ollama service before retrying.
FRONTAI_MODEL_INSTALL_RESPONSE_INVALID = Ollama reported an unexpected installation result. Check whether the model is installed before retrying.
FRONTAI_TEST_REJECTED = The provider rejected the test request. Check the model and account settings.
FRONTAI_TEST_PROVIDER_FAILURE = The provider failed while processing the test request.
FRONTAI_TEST_RESPONSE_TOO_LARGE = The provider response exceeded WebHome's safety limit.
FRONTAI_TEST_RESPONSE_INVALID = The provider returned a response that does not match its supported contract.
FRONTAI_MODELS_UNAUTHORIZED = OpenAI refused model discovery. Allow model-list read access for this key, or enter an identifier manually.
FRONTAI_MODELS_UNAVAILABLE = OpenAI model discovery is unavailable for this key or endpoint. You can still enter an identifier manually.
FRONTAI_MODELS_RESPONSE_INVALID = OpenAI returned an invalid model list. No model was selected automatically.
