FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_ADD = Add automation
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_CAPABILITIES_EMPTY = No permitted source event and target action are currently available. Enable the AI permissions in a source module and a target module first.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_LIST_EMPTY = No automation configured.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_NO_SELECTION = Select an automation to edit it.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_UNTITLED = Untitled automation
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_ENABLED_SHORT = Enabled
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_DISABLED_SHORT = Disabled
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_DETAILS = Automation details
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_READY = Complete
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_INCOMPLETE = Incomplete
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_ACTIVITY = Execution activity
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_RECENT_EXECUTIONS = Recent executions
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_APPLIED_ACTIONS = Applied actions
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_HOURLY_CALLS = Hourly calls
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_DAILY_CALLS = Daily calls
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_NAME = Name:
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_ENABLED = Enable this automation
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_SOURCE = Source event:
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_FIELDS = Exposed fields
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_INSTRUCTIONS = Optional instructions (filters or business rules):
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_TARGETS = Authorized target actions
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_CONFIRMATION = Execution:
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_CHOOSE_VALUE = Select a target value
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_CONFIRM_EACH = Ask for confirmation
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_AUTOMATIC = Run automatically
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_AUTOMATIC_REQUIRED = Always stored as an alert
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_DELETE = Delete automation
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_TOO_MANY_CONTEXTS = The account already contains the maximum of 32 automations.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_INSTRUCTIONS_INVALID = Leave this field empty or enter at most 16 KiB of instructions.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE = A source or target module no longer provides a capability used by this automation.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_PERMISSION_DENIED = A module no longer permits a field or action used by this automation.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_QUEUE_FULL = The automation queue is full. No cursor was advanced; try again after the pending work completes.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_BUDGET_EXCEEDED = The hourly or daily automation budget has been reached. No cursor was advanced.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_INTERRUPTED = The automation was stopped because the account lifecycle changed.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_INVALID = The automation configuration or model action does not match the supported schema.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_ACTION_REJECTED = The target module rejected the proposed AI action.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_ACTION_AMBIGUOUS = The target service may have applied the action, but its response could not be confirmed. WebHome will not retry it automatically.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_COMPLETED = The AI automation completed successfully.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_REQUEST_INVALID = The automation request exceeded its safety limits and was not sent.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE = The browser could not reach the AI provider for this automation. Check its URL, CSP, CORS policy and network availability.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_PROVIDER_TIMEOUT = The AI provider did not complete the automation request within 180 seconds. No action was retried automatically.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_MODEL_UNAVAILABLE = The configured model is unavailable for this automation.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_PROVIDER_FAILED = The AI provider rejected or failed while processing the automation request.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_RESPONSE_INVALID = The AI provider returned a response that does not match the closed automation schema.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_OLLAMA_RESPONSE_INCOMPLETE = Ollama produced only reasoning or reached the configured output limit before completing the automation response. Nothing was applied. Increase the output-token limit or retry with a more suitable model.
FRONTAI_AUTOMATION_RESERVATION_FAILED = WebHome could not safely reserve this source item between sessions. No provider request was sent; it will be retried after a later synchronization.
