MODULE_CHAT_CONVERSATION_TITLE = Conversation title:
MODULE_CHAT_FAVORITE = Add to favorites
MODULE_CHAT_UNFAVORITE = Remove from favorites
MODULE_CHAT_DELETE = Delete conversation
MODULE_CHAT_DELETE_ACTION = Delete
MODULE_CHAT_DELETE_CONFIRM_TITLE = Delete this conversation?
MODULE_CHAT_DELETE_CONFIRM = The conversation and all its messages will be deleted permanently.
MODULE_CHAT_ROLE_USER = You
MODULE_CHAT_ROLE_ASSISTANT = Assistant
MODULE_CHAT_CONTEXT_TRUNCATED = The oldest messages were excluded from this request to stay within the context limits. They remain in the conversation.
MODULE_CHAT_REQUEST_CANCELLED = The response was cancelled locally and will be ignored. The provider may already have processed the request.
MODULE_CHAT_AI_LOADING = The AI configuration is still loading.
MODULE_CHAT_AI_REQUIRED = Configure and save a provider in the Configuration tab first.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_DOCUMENT_INVALID = This conversation data is invalid or uses an unsupported version.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_DOCUMENT_TOO_LARGE = This AI Chat history has reached its 1 MiB encrypted storage limit.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_CONVERSATION_LIMIT = This account already contains the maximum of 32 conversations. Delete one before creating another.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_CONVERSATION_MISSING = This conversation no longer exists.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_TITLE_INVALID = The conversation title is too long or invalid.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_MESSAGE_LIMIT = This conversation has reached its 100-message limit. Create a new conversation.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_MESSAGE_INVALID = The message must contain text and be no larger than 64 KiB.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_RETRY_REQUIRED = The last message is still awaiting a response. Retry it before sending another message.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_RETRY_UNAVAILABLE = There is no pending message to retry.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_REQUEST_INVALID = The history cannot be sent within the allowed limits.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_BUSY = Two LLM requests are already active. Try again when one has finished.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_INSECURE_TRANSPORT = An HTTP LLM service cannot be contacted from an HTTPS page.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_WEBHOME_ORIGIN = The LLM provider cannot use the WebHome origin.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_ORIGIN_NOT_ALLOWED = This Ollama origin is not allowed by the WebHome configuration.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_TRANSPORT = The browser could not reach the provider. Check the network, CSP and CORS policy.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_TIMEOUT = The provider did not complete the response within 180 seconds.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_UNAUTHORIZED = The provider rejected the credential or direct browser access.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_RATE_LIMITED = The provider's request limit or usage budget was reached.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_MODEL_UNAVAILABLE = The configured model is not available from this provider.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_OLLAMA_WITHOUT_TEXT = Ollama did not produce final text within the configured limit.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_PROVIDER = The provider rejected or failed while processing the request.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_RESPONSE_TOO_LARGE = The response exceeds the text limit WebHome can store in one message.
MODULE_CHAT_ERROR_RESPONSE_INVALID = The provider response does not match the supported format.
MODULE_CHAT_SAVE_CRYPTO_ERROR = The AI Chat history could not be encrypted or decrypted. No unsafe data was sent.
MODULE_CHAT_SAVE_INTERRUPTED = Saving the AI Chat history was interrupted by an account or page transition.
MODULE_CHAT_SAVE_OUTDATED = A newer AI Chat history was found on the server and reloaded.
